	// reading and -1 when this asked for the fallback's first pass (under its own id when the rules decide, beside the reading when a doubt does): the caller returns its `us-requests`. A
	// fallback that was asked, usable or not, is final: 0 (a usable one was taken before this was called). `bitmap` is the page's raster, `dpi` its resolution, `loc` the locale hint.
